{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On iOS, this occurs because the system NFC stack always pre-selects the national AID1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applet before the SDK receives the tag. The card’s security policy blocks cross-applet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access to the ICAO applet from within an AID1 secure messaging session."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is a platform constraint, not an SDK error. Passive auth works normally on Android."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Case","externalID":"s:6EidKit17PassiveAuthStatusO12notSupportedyA2CmF","title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","symbolKind":"case","modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus"]]},"references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus/notSupported":{"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"PassiveAuthStatus","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Result of passive authentication — verifies that the data on the card was signed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Romanian state (MAI) and has not been tampered with."}]},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","abstract":[],"title":"EidKit","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"}}}